Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.09,0:00:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.29,0:00:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You sure? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  让我帮你把头盔戴好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, let me just straighten out your helmet there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  爸爸  不  一个爸爸  二个妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks, Daddy. No, no. One daddy, two mommies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你去吧  没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, it's all yours. Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油  加油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There you go, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是小班第一次骑脚踏车   我真的是好兴奋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, Ben's first big kid's bike. This is so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我还记得我的第一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, I remember mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我六岁的生日  我爸带我到公园去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was my sixth birthday. My dad took me to the park...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚坐上脚踏车  它就垮了  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I got on it and...it bent. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来就没有属于自己的脚踏车  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I never had a bike of my own. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们家很穷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, we didn't have a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但住在对街的女孩  有一辆最酷的脚踏车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But the girl across the street had the best bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是粉红色的  把手挂着五颜六色的流苏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was pink and it had rainbow-colored tassels hanging off the handle grips...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有铃铛   一个白色的大篮子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and-and-and a bell, and this big, white wicker basket...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上面黏着塑胶做的小雏菊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with those plastic daisies stuck on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来很像是我的第一辆脚踏车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That sounds like my first bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸把他以前的脚踏车送给了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My dad gave me his old one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个女孩让你骑吗   不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did the girl ever let you ride it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.10,0:01:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她把装脚踏车的纸箱送给了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But she gave me the box that it came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纸箱前面印了脚踏车的图案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It had a picture of the bike on the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以坐在上面  我继父会拖着我在后院跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I would sit on it and my stepdad would drag me around the backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.40,0:01:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的太不公平了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is so unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不能那么说   我也会拖着他跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not really, I got to drag him around too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.16,0:01:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第9集  糖果皇后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends S07E09  The One With All The Candy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.89,0:01:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你们在做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在为邻居做糖果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Making holiday candy for the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  你说谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要在门上挂一个篮子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna hang this basket on the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.67,0:02:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要邻居一走过去   就可以拿一块糖果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and when the neighbors walk by, they can all take a piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们不认识我们的邻居   我认识啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But we don't know the neighbors. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我想一想   那个留胡子的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's, uh, let's see, the guy with the mustache...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.85,0:02:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老烟枪婆婆   我看过一些孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...smokes-a-lot lady, some kids I've seen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.44,0:02:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有红头发的男人  他不喜欢别人叫他小红\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and the red-haired guy who does not like to be called Rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧   这就是我要做糖果的原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, this is exactly why I'm making this candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样可以知道他们的名字来认识邻居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can learn their names and get to know our neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搬家应该会比较简单一点吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wouldn't it be easier if we just moved?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人心情不错啊   我为什么要心情不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, somebody's in a good mood. Well, why shouldn't I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.17,0:02:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有很棒的朋友   有很棒的工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have great friends. I have a wonderful job...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且可以在办公室跟助理鬼混\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where you can make out with your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来啊  那也没什么大不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, it's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们整晚没睡  都在想计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We stayed up all night coming up with a plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确保我们的交往不会有问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so that us dating will not be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  你们想出了什么计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah? What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们  我们不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We-We are not...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.73,0:03:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...going to let it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.86,0:03:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变成问题吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们花了一整晚   想出那个计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. It took you all night to come up with that plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.86,0:03:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  我们还做了别的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well, you know, we did other stuff too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.57,0:03:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you two...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  莫尼卡  我不会在第一次约会时就跟男伴上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Monica come on, you know I don't sleep with guys on the first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦特威尔  马克林恩   班韦斯  我已经不会了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Matt Wire, Mark Lynn, Ben Wise. Anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,秦格  今天我要开会  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Tag, um, I have a conference call today, is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  4点开会   谢谢你   没事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, at 4. Okay, thank you, that'll be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.59,0:03:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.43,0:03:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没发现我们在谈恋爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That mail guy had no idea there was something going on between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得回去工作了  好吧   工作狂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd better get back to my desk. Okay, you hard worker!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会在你的评估表里提到那一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll remember to put that in your evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.25,0:04:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哪一点   你已经来上班两个月了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My what? You've been here for two months now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的上司必须为你的表现做个评估\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and your boss is required to hand in a performance evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你知道吗  有一件事  我至今还没有做评估\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you know, there is one thing that I have yet to evaluate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.85,0:04:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是认真的吗  不  我一直都想那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you serious? No, I've just always wanted to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以帮我把东西捡起来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you help me clean this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,篮子是空的  天呐  邻居们把糖果都吃掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The basket is totally empty. My God, the neighbors ate all the candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  不然的话就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, either that or, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你吃掉给邻居们的糖果了吗   本来我打算要那么做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you eat all the neighbor candy? Uh, well, yeah, that was the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我走到篮子边时   发现里面就只剩几块糖果了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But by the time I got to it there was only a couple of pieces left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整天人潮川流不急   他们喜欢的不得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. They've been coming by all day. They love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们喜欢我的糖果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They love my candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊   我得多做点了   嘿   摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man, I gotta go make more. Hey, Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多做一点千层面  因为有人可能吃了一大块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you might wanna make some more lasagna too. because something might have happened to a huge chunk of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我的邻居吃光了我的糖果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, the neighbors ate all my candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.69,0:05:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的邻居偷走我的报纸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mine stole my newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这简直就是犯罪潮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's like a crime wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.23,0:05:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你有空吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, you, uh, got a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从你告诉我  那个脚踏车的故事后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ever since you, uh, told me that story about that bike...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它一直就在我脑中挥之不去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I couldn't stop thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说大家都该有第一辆脚踏车  你知道吗  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, everyone should have a first bike, you know? So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊   罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢吗   我爱死它了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You like it? I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗   喔  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? Oh. Oh, God...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.93,0:05:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I love you. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是那一种爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.47,0:05:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这辆脚踏车   让你跟我更亲近了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But the bike got you a lot closer. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.31,0:05:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样  把它拿到楼下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, uh, take it downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:05:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试骑一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, give it a test drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:06:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的第一辆脚踏车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My first bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.19,0:06:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你   这是我收过的最棒的礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you for the best present I've ever gotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德都快哭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, and Chandler's about to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  我很勇敢  我很勇敢  我我很勇敢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry, I'm brave. I am brave. I-I am brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.55,0:06:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请问你是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you tell me who is there, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是盖瑞   我住在楼上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My name's Gary. I live upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道现在几点了吗   现在是糖果时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you know what time it is? It's candy time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我室友说它们吃起来   就像是天上掉下来的礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My roommate says that they taste like little drops of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, please. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗   "天上掉下来的礼物"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you hear that? "Little drops of heaven."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凌晨4点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Four a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:06:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能给我一点糖果吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So can I get some candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起   我们之中还有人得早起去上班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am sorry, but some of us have to get up early and go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不知道我不是 "那个人"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He does not know that I am not "some of us."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.72,0:07:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  但明天一大早我会做一些糖果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, listen, I'm sorry, but I'll put some out first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧   我待会儿再来拿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, okay, I'll swing by later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你住在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You live in this building? Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该会记得你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm. Seems like I would have remembered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚安   盖瑞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm. Night, Gar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看了你的评估表吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So did you read your evaluation yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.46,0:07:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  上面写了 "极机密"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it was marked "confidential."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚把它送到人事处了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just sent it down to Human Resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.51,0:07:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  你是在开玩笑  对吧  我故意写那份评估表来跟你开玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, please, you're kidding, right? I wrote that one as a joke for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会喜欢这个玩笑吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A joke they would appreciate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm thinking no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:08:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你写了什么   我说你是个接吻高手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did you say? Um, I said that you were a good kisser...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你又小又挺的屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and, uh, that I liked your your tiney-tiny touchie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不该那么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, not my touchie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有更糟糕的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于你的主动性   我写\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When asked if you take initiative, I wrote:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"他几乎不需要指导  就能解开我的胸罩"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Yes, he was able to unhook my bra with minimal supervision."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至于你的表现会不会有问题  我写  "天啊  希望不要有"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And under problems with performance, I wrote, "Dear God, I hope not."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后然后我画了一个微笑的小脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then, uh-And then I drew a little smiley face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一张色情小素描\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then a small pornographic sketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你送菲比脚踏车真的太贴心了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, that is so sweet of you to get Phoebe that bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到那个故事  差点就哭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I heard the story, I almost cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你差点哭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Almost cried, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗   钱德  "差点"哭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hear that, Chandler? "Almost" cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.24,0:08:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要有人提到《铁达尼号》  你每次都会哭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you cry every time somebody talks about Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个只有彼此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Those two had only each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:08:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比真的很喜欢它吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe really likes the bike, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我看到她带着它过街\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. I saw her walking it down the street the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,车篮子里面还有花   真的很可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She had these flowers in the basket. It was so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天早上我还看到她   带着它在公园里散步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I saw her this morning walking it by the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   她带着脚踏车  两次都是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute, she was walking the bike? Both times?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  菲比  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs. Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢脚踏车吗   非常喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, so you enjoying the bike? Oh, uh-huh, so much. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你会骑脚踏车吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, you, uh-You do know how to ride a bike, don't you? Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能看看你骑脚踏车吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can we see you ride it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早就跟你说过了   不要跟助理交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is why I told you never get involved with your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要是地下情   绝对是纸包不住火的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And there's no such thing as keeping secrets when it comes to having affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗   钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you hear that, Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纸是包不住火的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事   我只是在吃糖果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened? I'm just eating candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许没有那么糟糕   他们可能看不懂我的意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe it's not as bad as I think. Y'know, maybe they didn't take it the way I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.33,0:10:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然   你知道吗   因为"小屁屁"可以指屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Absolutely, you know? Because "tushy" can mean both ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者是好员工\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and good worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得把评估表拿回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, I just gotta get the thing back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋   还记得你提到的素描吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach? That sketch you mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它跟这素描很像吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Might it have looked a little something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.13,0:10:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊   乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么了  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is the matter with you? God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我买不起色情杂志前   这点天份还蛮有用的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boy I tell ya, this little talent came in handy before I could afford porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.94,0:10:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   对不起  我知道现在是休息时间  但我真的需要糖果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, I'm sorry. I know it's after hours, but I really need candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.78,0:11:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我帮不了你  看到了吗  没规定就是规定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, I can't help you. See? Rules are rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  我住在外地的朋友  今天来看我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, I have people coming from out of town today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他们提起你的糖果   开玩笑吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told them all about your candy. No kidding,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是外地来的   你怎么跟他们说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Out-of-towners, huh? Heh. What did you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.58,0:11:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉他们你的糖果   真的是好吃到无法形容\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told them your candy was absolutely indescribable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人说它是 "天上 掉下来的礼物"  但那不重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, some people have been saying it's "little drops of heaven," but whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托   你不能帮帮我吗  钱德   我们认识那位女士吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, can't you help me out? Hey, Chandler, do we know that lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能吧  她不是住在你楼下做爱时会大叫的那个女人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe. Isn't she the woman who lives below you and has sex really loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   我只破例一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'll do it just this Once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不能告诉任何人  好  求求你  快给我吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you can't tell anybody. Yes, yes, please, just give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  就是她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  不可思议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信纸条居然没有用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe that sign didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道怎么才会有用吗   别再做糖果了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what would work? Stop making candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们喜欢它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But they like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说他们喜欢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean they like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你当厨师的原因   你要大家喜欢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that why you became a chef, so that people would like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要跟我谈怎么让别人喜欢你吗   小丑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. You want to talk about getting people to like you, huh, funny man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记住我教你的一切  你会没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now, just remember everything I taught you and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  开始吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.86,0:12:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就位  预备\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ready, set--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.98,0:12:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下   这个座垫真的很不舒服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, this seat is really uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不如先换掉再来练习\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe before we start we should just get another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们该换个飞机座椅  或懒骨头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Perhaps like an airplane seat, or a beanbag chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你不能逃避这件事  你得学会骑脚踏车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you can't get out of this, okay? You have to learn how to ride a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.21,0:12:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  为什么我非学不可\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why do I have to learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以防发生紧急事故  什么样的紧急事故\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, in case of an emergency. What kind of emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人走过来   拿枪抵着你的头说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well let there—what if a man comes along and puts a gun to your head and says:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.39,0:12:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"快骑上脚踏车  不然我会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"You ride this bike or I'll--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会开枪打你"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll shoot you."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会按铃铛分散他的注意力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I would ring the bell to distract him...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我会用中国飞镖   把那个家伙敲昏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and then I would knock the gun out of his hand with a Chinese throwing star.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   菲比  快坐上脚踏车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Phoebe, just get on the bike...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会扶着你   推你  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and, hey, I'll hold you up and push you. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会放手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You won't let go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会  你发誓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. You swear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.45,0:13:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.46,0:13:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  要开始了  好吗   好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here we go. All right? All right? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉不错吧   好了  试着踩踏板\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Feel good? All right, try pedaling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  做的好  对  控制住车子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it, you're doing great. Yes, take control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.01,0:13:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, yes, yes. Whee! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你发过誓的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You swore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你骑得很好了  我真的很震惊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just thought you were doing so well. I am shocked. Shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都是那样子学脚踏车的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a legitimate learning technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:13:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外面有些人在问糖果的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's, uh, some people outside asking about candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们得等  好吗  我只有两只手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, they're just gonna have to wait, aren't they? I only got two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要我帮忙吗  不  你不熟悉流程\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Need some help? No, you don't know the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望任何人破坏我的流程\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't need nobody messing with the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  你结婚前一个星期  不会常常看到我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}By the way, the week before your wedding, you may not see a lot of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.20,0:14:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  骗子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hello, liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我真的很抱歉  放开了你的脚踏车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I'm really sorry I let go of the bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能会没命的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could've been killed, I hope you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你能再试一次吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But can we please try it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  你只差一点就成功了  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you were so close, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.18,0:14:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我很乐意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I would love to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.51,0:14:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但脚踏车被偷了  警察找不到嫌犯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but the bike got stolen and the police have no suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不学骑脚踏车  那么我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you are not going to learn how to ride this bike, then I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得把它收回去  什么  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm just gonna have to take it back. What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为  因为它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because. Because it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它就像你买了这把吉他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It'd be like you having this guitar...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.63,0:15:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却从来不弹它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and never playing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这把吉他希望被弹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, this guitar wants to be played.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这辆脚踏车希望被骑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And this bike wants to be ridden.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不骑它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if you don't ride it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是在扼杀它的灵魂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you're killing its spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脚踏车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The bike...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is dying"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  如果你真的那么在乎不惜撒下漫天大谎  我学就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. If you care enough to make up that load of crap, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让脚踏车非常快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're making the bike very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道啦  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请不要死掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得在他们看到评估表前  把它拿回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I think we can get the evaluation back before they see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们得溜进塞纳的办公室   通常他十点才会到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to get into Mr. Zelner's office. Now, he doesn't get in until 10, so he's no problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.89,0:16:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他的助理贝蒂   一大早就会到办公室吃早餮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But his assistant, Betty, comes in early to eat her breakfast at her desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真的很悲惨   没错  贝蒂有点惨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's kind of sad. Yeah, well, Betty's kind of sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我相信我可以用这些巧克力把她诱开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which is why I believe I can lure her away with these chocolates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我诱开她后   你就跑进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, while I distract her, you go in the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了  行动吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Got it. Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   瑞秋  你有空吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, Rachel. You, uh, got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.91,0:16:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  塞纳先生  你有事吗   我随时都有空\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, sure, Mr. Zelner. For you? Anything. Minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,取消计划  取消计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Abort the plan. Abort the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我想跟你们两个谈一谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, actually, I'd like to speak to both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事需要帮忙吗  塞纳先生  或许你想吃点巧克力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well can we, can we get you anything, Mr. Zelner? Maybe some chocolates?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  谢谢你  但我可以把它们送给贝蒂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, no, thanks, but I'll give these to Betty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过你对泰格做的评估表\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I read your evaluation of Tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我该叫他的全名  泰格"小可爱"琼斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or, uh, to use his full name, Tag "Sweet Cheeks" Jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们之间有什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is something going on with you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊   你能想像如果有  会怎么样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, can you imagine if there was?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是那样的话  会怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, what would happen exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样啊   我一定得写份报告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'd be forced to file a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得跟法律部门商量\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd have to consult with the legal department.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在公司的未来  可能会有问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And your future at the company would be in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  塞纳先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well-Uh, Mr. Zelner...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.85,0:17:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那份评估表是我写的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm the one who filled in that evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  不  对  对  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为这样会很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought it would be funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你写着你有可爱的小屁屁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wrote that you have a cute tushy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的幽默感很奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have a weird sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很奇怪地   我以自己的屁股为荣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm kind of strangely proud of my butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.45,0:18:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开这种玩笑太危险了  秦格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's kind of a risky joke, Tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是在画的什么   我看不懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what is-what is this drawing? I can't figure out what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它倒过来了  你知道吗  那不重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're looking at it upside down-You know what? It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是没有幽默感的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, it's not like I don't have a sense of humor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我甚至很喜欢写挑逗性的打油诗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hell, I even enjoy a naughty limerick every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但时间跟地点是很重要的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But there's a time and a place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.51,0:18:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你有写打油诗的灵感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless you, uh, have a limerick right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.81,0:18:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有吗  好吧   你知道我的传真机号码\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No? Okay. Well, uh, you've got my fax number.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信你会那么做   那太贴心了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you did that. That was really sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.41,0:18:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  你可能会丢掉工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, don't worry about it. No, you could've lost your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.54,0:18:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吗  有这么可爱的屁股  我一定能找到工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding me? With a cute butt like this, I'd find work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你   你太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, you're great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗   什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉棒极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.63,0:19:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.22,0:19:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.98,0:19:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是我花了很多时间才把桌子整理好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just-It took me so long to get that desk organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.23,0:19:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在等糖果   把糖果拿出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're waiting for the candy. Bring out the candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  小姐   快给我们糖果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, lady, give us candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.84,0:19:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事   兄弟   你在做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up, buddy? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.72,0:19:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在等着拿糖果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Waiting to get candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.93,0:19:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   你不能在这里抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, and you cannot smoke in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:20:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糖果做好了  我得让它冷却15分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, guys, the candy is coming. I just need 15 minutes for the chocolate to cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  大伙们  安静  安静  请闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, everybody, just be quiet. Be quiet. Be quiet. Pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is the matter with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个女人在为你们做好事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This woman was trying to do a nice thing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她想做糖果  是为了要认识你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was making candy so she could try to get to know all of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我敢说你们没有人   能叫出她的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I'll bet that not one of you can tell me her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.05,0:20:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没说错吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是糖果小姐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Candy Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.39,0:20:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是 "糖果小姐"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, not "Candy Lady."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.47,0:20:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道她的名字就能拿到糖果吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, if we know it, can we have candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   你们知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忘了糖果  你们毁了一切  毁了一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Forget it. All of you, forget it. You've ruined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.73,0:20:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回家去吧  你们毁了一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go home. You've ruined it. You've ruined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是不对的  你们毁了一切  你们毁了这个机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's all wrong. You guys ruined everything. You ruined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢   别客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.17,0:20:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你抽了烟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:21:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  老烟枪婆婆  把烟直接喷入我的嘴巴里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, smokes-a-lot lady blew smoke directly into my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事   但刚刚真的有点可怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm fine now, but it was really scary there for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人将恐吓纸条   塞到门缝下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, someone slipped a threatening note under the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我很抱歉  我受到暴动状态的影响\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Sorry about that. Mob mentality or whatever. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信  我办到了  我会骑脚踏车了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe it. I did it. I rode a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没想过我能这么做   谢谢你  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I never thought I'd be able to do that. Thank you, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  别谢我  谢谢你自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, don't thank me. Thank yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你面对了自己的恐惧   终于克服了它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're the one who faced your fears and ultimately overcame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说些陈腔滥调的话  又不是《我的这一班》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't be so corny, Ross. It's not an After School Special.
